---
layout: base.njk
title: Citation Report
description: Track which ASW Hub insights are cited in Claude, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Microsoft Copilot — the five AI engines Maxifi Digital monitors for ATM operator questions.
permalink: /citation-report/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Citation Report · Last updated {{ citations.summary.lastUpdated }}</p>
    <h1>How AI is citing the hub</h1>
    <p>Per-engine citation tracking across five AI platforms — Claude, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Microsoft Copilot. Hub launched May 2026; first citation audit publishes June 2026.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Insights tracked</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700;">{{ citations.insights.length }}</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #999;">Live at launch</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Engines monitored</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700;">{{ citations.engines.length }}</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #999;">{% for e in citations.engines %}{{ e.name }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">First audit</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700;">Jun</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #999;">Results published {{ citations.summary.firstAuditDue }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600;">Pre-event baseline — first measurement June 2026</p>
      <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #555;">The hub launched in May 2026, ahead of Airspace World (26–28 May, Lisbon). AI engines index new content over several weeks. The first citation audit runs June 2026 — results will populate the grid below automatically on the next build.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Citation status by insight</h2>
    <p style="color: #666; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">Each cell shows whether that AI engine cited this insight in the latest audit. Green = cited; grey = not yet.</p>

    <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
      <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.875rem;">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #f5f5f5; border-bottom: 2px solid #e0e0e0; white-space: nowrap;">Insight</th>
            {% for engine in citations.engines %}
            <th style="text-align: center; padding: 0.75rem 0.75rem; background: #f5f5f5; border-bottom: 2px solid #e0e0e0; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 0.75rem;">{{ engine.name }}</th>
            {% endfor %}
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for insight in citations.insights %}
          <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;">
            <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 500;">
              <a href="/insights/{{ insight.id }}/" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">{{ insight.title }}</a>
            </td>
            {% for engine in citations.engines %}
            {% set engineData = insight.engines[engine.id] %}
            <td style="text-align: center; padding: 1rem 0.75rem;">
              {% if engineData and engineData.cited %}
                <a href="{{ engineData.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Cited by {{ engine.name }}" style="display: inline-block; width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; background: #16a34a; border-radius: 50%; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5rem; color: white; font-size: 0.7rem; text-decoration: none;">✓</a>
              {% else %}
                <span title="Not yet cited by {{ engine.name }}" style="display: inline-block; width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; background: #e5e7eb; border-radius: 50%;"></span>
              {% endif %}
            </td>
            {% endfor %}
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #aaa;">✓ = cited in latest monthly audit &nbsp;·&nbsp; ○ = not yet cited &nbsp;·&nbsp; Click ✓ to see the source response</p>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight" style="border-bottom: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="maxifi-cta">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Methodology</p>
        <h2>How citations are tracked</h2>
        <p>Each month, a standard set of ATM operator queries is submitted manually to all five engines. A citation is recorded when an engine either links directly to a hub page or quotes its content verbatim. Results update here on the first of each month. To update: set <code>cited: true</code> and add the <code>url</code> in <code>src/_data/citations.json</code>, then rebuild.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="maxifi-cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/insights/">All insights →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/aeo-audit-hub/">Full AEO audit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
